	(text "J14 (fitted) / J22 (DNP) mate with carrier J15/J18: logic 5 V / SDA / GND / SCL / raw 5 V / SYNC.\nJ17 is the separate mains feed. USB can power logic without powering relay/opto actuators.\nOnly one new/recovery board at the selected default address; other addressed boards may remain connected."
